The Powder Toy

Mouse  draw with the element (left button), erase (right button)
Mouse wheel  brush size
Tab  circle, square or triangle brush
Space  pause, F  one frame on
Z  zoom
S  save a stamp, L  load the last, K  stamp library
0 to 9  view mode
E  find an element
G, Shift + G  grid size
H  hide the HUD
W  gravity mode, Y  air mode
P  screenshot
Q or Esc  quit
